# Essence spam, make room, then the bench: the league-start minion wand.
#
# A Deafening Essence of Fear guarantees minion damage on a one-handed weapon
# and reforges everything else; it is spammed until +1 to Level of all Minion
# Skill Gems rolls beside it. The two are then locked in with the prefixes
# metamod and everything else scoured away, which frees the suffixes for the
# multimod and the final crafts.

item {
    base:   "Convoking Wand"
    ilvl:   84
    rarity: normal
}

def keeper() = has "level of all minion skill gems" and has "minions deal increased damage"

until keeper() {
    essence "fear" t1
}

# The lock is a suffix of its own and keeps every prefix, so a third prefix must
# go first, and a suffix slot must be open. An annul that takes one of the kept
# modifiers sends the craft back to the essences.
until keeper() and prefixCount <= 2 and suffixCount <= 2 {
    if keeper() {
        annul
    } else {
        essence "fear" t1
    }
}

# Scouring leaves the locked prefixes and takes the suffixes, the lock with them.
bench "prefixes cannot be changed"
scour

bench "can have up to 3 crafted modifiers"
bench "cast speed"
bench "maximum mana"
